ocument where both the father and the  mother say they agree kentaro talks to  aki and tells her that he's pregnant and  that he's sure she is the mother but  that he doesn't want to have the baby so  he asks her to sign the papers aki tells  him that she agrees with him but just  when he was going to sign the agreement  kentaro gets dizzy and vomits all over  the paper they don't sign anything the  next day aki goes to see a friend and  tells her about the pregnancy the friend  tries to convince her to have the baby  since she believes it's a blessing  later in a cafe aki sees kantaro again  ostensibly to sign the agreement but  this time aki tells him that she does  want to have the baby kintaro replies  that she is being selfish and isn't  thinking about what he's going to go  through aki ends up signing the paper  and kintaro goes to his work however  when he arrives they tell him that due  to his strange behavior his project has  been assigned to someone else  chapter 3 kentaro goes to the hospital  to schedule the day for the intervention  and while there he meets another man who  is also pregnant they go to dinner to  talk about their experiences and the man  explains to kintaro how excited he is to  have a baby which makes kintaro question  whether to have the intervention or not  the agency where kintaro works presents  the finished project to their investors  but they reject the proposal saying that  the project is boring and that  everything on it has already been seen  before at that moment kintaro decides to  propose that they add pregnant men to  the project and tells them that they can  use him as a model revealing to them  that he is going to have a baby the  investors are surprised and quickly  accept the proposal saying that it is  something unique and that it will surely  attract a lot of attention and at that  moment the agency decides to promote  cantaru back as project leader kentaro  talks to aki and tells her that he's  going to have the baby haki replies that  she's going to help him with everything  later kentaro talks to his mom on the  phone to tell her the news she's worried  because she tells him that he's going to  get a lot of criticism for being a man  and pregnant days later kintaro is used  as a model for the project and the  photos of him pregnant end up being  published everywhere chapter four  kintaro's photos go viral and receive  several comments some of them are funny  others surprising and still others begin  to show support for pregnant men  meanwhile aki continues her work but at  the same time she begins to do a  personal project in which she writes  what it's like to be the partner of a  pregnant man one day kintaro goes to a  checkup at the hospital accompanied by  aki and there they're told that the baby  is going to be a boy kintaro stays to  see his friend that he met at the  hospital who's also pregnant they decide  to create a page where pregnant men can  share their experiences and people can  support them several pregnant men begin  to join that page kenturo decides to  organize a meeting in a restaurant and  several men attend they all become fast  friends and give each other advice on  another day kintaro and aki go out for a  walk and kintaro tells her that they  should start thinking about getting  married and buying a home so they can  raise the baby however aki tells him  that she doesn't want to get married at  that moment kintara receives a call  telling him that his pregnant friend is  in the hospital he and daki go there  immediately and when they arrive they  tell him that his friend lost his baby  kenturo speaks to his friend's wife and  she tells him that she's relieved the  baby was not born since she believes  that society was going to make fun of  him kintaro begins to think that perhaps  society will not accept his son and  remembering that aki does not want to  marry him he decides to break up with  her to raise the child alone  chapter 5 aki goes to a family event and  as soon as she arrives her parents begin  to pressure her telling her that she  should get a man and have children  kantaru goes to work and in a meeting  they tell him that they already have a  long-term project to show his life after  his baby is born kintaro feels pressured  by the project and also begins to feel  sentimental about the pregnancy however  the boss and his colleagues try to calm  him down although we see that they only  do it because it generates benefits for  the company aki goes to a meeting with  friends and there she hears a lot of bad  comments about pregnant men she starts  thinking about what kantaro must be  going through augie decides to see her  parents again and this time she tells  them that she has a boyfriend and that  he is pregnant with her baby then she  decides to call kintaro and convinces  him to start a family without getting  married kintaro accepts and tells her  that he's very happy because they're  going to start a family since he only  had his mother when he was a child his  father died when he was very young at  that very moment a man approaches  kantaro and tells him that he is his  father  chapter six  kintaro asks his mother if that man is  really his father and she has no choice  but to confess that it is true and  explains that she lied about him having  died because that man abandoned her  later kintaro lets his father stay in  his home and he tells him that he was  the one who gave birth to him so we see  that he too was a pregnant man the  father tells him about the experiences  he had and then asked him to do a  project together to create items for  pregnant men kenturo decides to tell his  mother about that project but his mom  tells him not to do business with his  father since she knows him to be just a  scammer kintaro goes to talk to his  father about canceling the project but  he realizes that his father has already  met with several pregnant men and has  convinced them to invest in the business  meanwhile aki receives a very good job  offer but for that she must relocate far  away aki calls kintaro to try to  convince him to move together but  kintaro refuses because he has a job  there the next day kintaro finds out  that his father scammed the pregnant men  and that he left with all the money  they'd put into the project news of this  goes viral and people start saying that  kintaro is also a scammer just like his  father  chapter seven kintaro beats his friend  who was pregnant and they both talk  about how difficult it is to be a  pregnant man then kintaro decides to  look for his father and ask for  explanations about why he left meanwhile  kintaro's mom and daki talk about what  it's like to be the partner of a  pregnant man and both say that it's hard  to get over the fact that they're not  the ones giving birth to the baby  kintaro finds his father and confronts  him for having left he replies that he  did that because he suffered a lot in  the past when he was pregnant since back  then society was tougher and they made a  lot of fun of him kentaro's father  apologizes to him and returns the money  he stole telling him not to follow in  his footsteps and to live life no matter  what they say later kintaro returns home  and talks to aki she tells him that  she's going to accept the job offer  which is only for two years saying that  she'll try to visit him from time to  time a couple of days later kintaro goes  to a conference to explain what happened  with his father while aki goes to the  airport to take her work trip then  kintaro explains that he had nothing to  do with the fraud and takes the  opportunity to say how much pregnant men  suffer from bad comments made by people  tentaro finishes his speech and just at  that moment falls to the ground feeling  a lot of pain aki is watching what's  happening on tv and she decides to  cancel her trip and help quintaro  chapter 8. they take kintaro to the  hospital where his mother father and aki  